@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 观察者模式：登录态变更驱动多个界面同步更新

abstract class Subject <<Subject>> {
  +attach(observer)
  +detach(observer)
  +notify()
}

interface Observer <<Observer>> {
  +update()
}

class AuthStore {
  +token
  +user
  +setSession()
  +clearSession()
}

class NavBar
class ProfileView
class RouteGuard
class LoginView

Subject <|-- AuthStore
Observer <|.. NavBar
Observer <|.. ProfileView
Observer <|.. RouteGuard
Observer <|.. LoginView

AuthStore --> Observer : notify()
NavBar --> AuthStore : 读取登录态
ProfileView --> AuthStore : 读取用户信息
RouteGuard --> AuthStore : 判断访问权限
LoginView --> AuthStore : 触发登录/退出

note bottom of AuthStore
Pinia store 更新后，依赖它的页面与组件
应同步重渲染或重新判断权限。
end note
@enduml
